    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count by size",
        "body": "On a $6\\times6$ board there are $6^2=36$ squares of size $1\\times1$, $5^2=25$ of size $2\\times2$, $4^2=16$ of size $3\\times3$, $3^2=9$, $2^2=4$ and $1^2=1$. (Check with the $3\\times3$ board: $9+4+1=14$.)\n\nTotal $36+25+16+9+4+1=91$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 91**"
      }
    ],
