        "body": "Write each person as cop or robber (a cop's statement is true, a robber's false).\n\n- (a) Colleen and Jakes are on the same side.\n- (c) Tandeka and Colleen are on the same side.\n- (b) Hendrik and Vishnu are on opposite sides.\n- (d) Jakes and Hendrik are on opposite sides.\n- (e) If Vishnu were a cop it would say that Tandeka and Colleen differ, but by (c) they are on the same side. So Vishnu's statement is false and Vishnu is a robber.\n\nThen Hendrik is a cop (by b), Jakes is a robber (by d), Colleen is a robber (by a) and Tandeka a robber (by c).\n\nRobbers: Vishnu, Jakes, Colleen, Tandeka, i.e. $4$.\n\n**Answer: (D) 4**"
